  "description": "Cross-platform child process management for .NET. ProcessGroup guarantees children are killed when the parent exits — kernel Job Objects on Windows, POSIX process groups on Linux/macOS/FreeBSD. ProcessRunner adds an async-first command runner with line-by-line streaming, bulk capture, stdin piping, timeouts, cancellation, and runtime diagnostics. AOT-compatible.",
